{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bird Coloring invites you into a peaceful world where creativity flows and stress fades away. Relax as you bring beautiful birds to life with your own unique touch, letting colors blend and imagination soar. It's your moment of calm in a busy world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/04147d4b4f2ac519f20dabb584e28974.gif?t=1742408363\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Bird Coloring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bird Coloring is your escape into a world of creativity and relaxation. As you bring each bird to life with your own colors, the stress of the day melts away. Every stroke feels satisfying, every choice is yours, and there\u2019s no wrong way to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/8b816003843aed146836e2f8ce0a18d7.gif?t=1742408363\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re adding vibrant splashes or gentle shades, the experience is calming and rewarding. Let your imagination take flight as you fill each bird with personality and charm. Sit back, unwind, and enjoy the simple joy of coloring!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591970?t=1742408363","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591970?t=1742408363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/b1f99b8be2c0603051344c2a00dea9f925c033e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742408363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/b1f99b8be2c0603051344c2a00dea9f925c033e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742408363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Bird Coloring</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/banner_bird_coloring.png?t=1742408363\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bird Coloring invites you into a peaceful world where creativity flows and stress fades away. Relax as you bring beautiful birds to life with your own unique touch, letting colors blend and imagination soar. It's your moment of calm in a busy world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/04147d4b4f2ac519f20dabb584e28974.gif?t=1742408363\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Bird Coloring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bird Coloring is your escape into a world of creativity and relaxation. As you bring each bird to life with your own colors, the stress of the day melts away. Every stroke feels satisfying, every choice is yours, and there\u2019s no wrong way to create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/extras/8b816003843aed146836e2f8ce0a18d7.gif?t=1742408363\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re adding vibrant splashes or gentle shades, the experience is calming and rewarding. Let your imagination take flight as you fill each bird with personality and charm. Sit back, unwind, and enjoy the simple joy of coloring!</p>","developers":["Hard Shark Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591970/44af2acbcb8d15223ca12